// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3982730719" "I need your assistance with a matter concerning a friend of mine. A lady friend. Recently, she has been fascinated by the magics of the Circle of Thorns. While I cannot fault her lust for power, I believe in this case she may have underestimated the danger the Circle can pose to one so gentle and trusting as she. I believe she is in great danger. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you would retrieve my lady friend from the Circle of Thorns, I will reward you handsomely.</a> If you cannot manage it, we will no longer be working together, and you will probably be dead. Either way, I will have learned something valuable about you."
// AcceptString :
"P4134353262" "Retrieve Bocor's friend from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P1611060434" "The lady in question made certain promises to me. I intend to make sure she does not wriggle free of them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3310701894" "Retrieve Olivia Starr"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1294252864" "Olivia's life is in your hands, {VillainName}. I will be most displeased if you do not take that seriously."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
